    {
      "id": 3261253,
      "name": "Maria Telie",
      "description": {
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "texts": {
          "en": "Maria Telie has been into hog fattening for 10 years. She is a married woman and has two dependent children. Her husband works as a driver.\n\nThis time, she wants to continue to grow her hog raising livelihood. She requested a loan and it was used to buy feed. This helps her to raise quality hogs and be able to roll out her capital. She is striving hard to continue to expand her hog raising livelihood and improve the quality of life, respectively."
        }
      },
