          "en"
        ],
        "texts": {
          "en": "Julius resides in the province of Cebu. He is 47 years old and single. To earn an income, he runs a computer shop. He has been in this business for 11 years.\n\nCurrently, he asks for a loan of PHP 35,000 through Kiva’s field partner, CEVI (a microfinance NGO) in the Philippines. He will use this loan to buy computer parts.\n\nJulius wants to improve this business in the future and become productive."
        }
