    {
      "id": 3261251,
      "name": "Evelyn",
      "description": {
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "texts": {
          "en": "Evelyn has operated a sari-sari (variety) store for the past six years. She sells various commodities ranging from noodles, canned goods, soft drinks, sugar, eggs, and soap, to beverages. She is a married woman with two dependent children. Her husband's occupation is a farmer.\n\nShe wanted to continue to improve her capital. That is why she has decided to request a loan. She will use it to buy canned goods, noodles, toiletries and soft drinks. With these, she can boost her inventory and maintain her sales and profit.\n\nShe is hoping for your support to continue to improve her existing project to become more productive in the future."
        }
      },
